#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:439
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_WelcomeSingleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the strategies of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE DOME!\p"
"I am your guide to the SINGLE BATTLE\n"
"Tournament.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家战术的地方！\p"
"欢迎来到对战巨蛋！\p"
"我是单打锦标赛的向导。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:446
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_TakeSinglesChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to challenge\n"
"the SINGLE BATTLE Tournament?$"
msgstr "你要挑战单打锦标赛吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:450
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_HopeToSeeYouAgain"
msgid "We hope to see you again.$"
msgstr "期待你再次光临。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:453
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ExplainSinglesChallenge"
msgid ""
"The SINGLE BATTLE Tournament\n"
"is exactly as the name suggests--\l"
"a tournament of SINGLE BATTLES.\p"
"All participating TRAINERS must\n"
"enter three POKéMON each.\p"
"In each battle, one of the three\n"
"POKéMON must be held in reserve.\p"
"The other two POKéMON can battle\n"
"one at a time.\p"
"Choose the two battling POKéMON after\n"
"examining the opponent's trio.\p"
"You win the tournament by defeating\n"
"four TRAINERS.\p"
"Battle Points are awarded to\n"
"the tournament winner.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"tournament, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"单打锦标赛正如其名，\n"
"是单打对战的锦标赛。\p"
"所有参赛的训练家\n"
"都要各带3只宝可梦参加。\p"
"每场对战中，3只宝可梦里\n"
"必须有1只留作候补。\p"
"另外2只宝可梦\n"
"逐一出场战斗。\p"
"请先观察对手的3只宝可梦，\n"
"再选择出战的2只宝可梦。\p"
"打败4位训练家，\n"
"就能赢得锦标赛冠军。\p"
"锦标赛的冠军\n"
"将获得对战点数。\p"
"如果想中断锦标赛，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:474
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_OkayToSaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Before I show you to the BATTLE DOME,\n"
"I must save the data. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"带你去对战巨蛋之前，\n"
"我必须先记录数据。可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:478
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"The tournament offers two levels\n"
"of challenge, Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice?$"
msgstr ""
"锦标赛的挑战有两种等级：\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级。\l"
"你要选哪一种？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:483
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_SelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Now select the three POKéMON that\n"
"you wish to enter, please.$"
msgstr ""
"现在，请选择\n"
"要参加的3只宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:487
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"Excuse me!\p"
"You don't have three eligible POKéMON.\p"
"Also, the POKéMON must be holding\n"
"different kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"不好意思！\p"
"你没有3只符合条件的宝可梦。\p"
"而且，宝可梦携带的道具\n"
"也必须各不相同。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:494
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid "Please come see me when you are ready.$"
msgstr "准备好以后请再来找我。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:497
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"Excuse me!\p"
"You don't have three eligible POKéMON.\p"
"You must have three different POKéMON\n"
"of Level 50 or less to enter.\p"
"They also must be holding different\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"不好意思！\p"
"你没有3只符合条件的宝可梦。\p"
"必须带上3只等级在50以下的\n"
"不同宝可梦才能参加。\p"
"而且，它们携带的道具\n"
"也必须各不相同。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:506
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ShowYouToBattleDome"
msgid ""
"I will now show you to\n"
"the BATTLE DOME.$"
msgstr "现在我带你去对战巨蛋。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:510
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeQuitting"
msgid ""
"Excuse me!\p"
"You didn't save before you quit your\n"
"challenge last time.\p"
"Because of that, your challenge so far\n"
"has been disqualified. Sorry!$"
msgstr ""
"不好意思！\p"
"你上次中断挑战之前\n"
"没有记录。\p"
"因此，你之前的挑战\n"
"已经被取消资格了。抱歉！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:517
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_CongratsForWinningTourney"
msgid ""
"Congratulations for winning\n"
"your Battle Tournament!$"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你赢得了\n"
"对战锦标赛的冠军！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:522
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_HereIsYourPrize"
msgid ""
"Here is your prize for your Battle\n"
"Tournament victory.$"
msgstr ""
"这是你在对战锦标赛中\n"
"获胜的奖品。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:527
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ReceivedPrize"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the prize\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}得到了奖品\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:532
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_BagFullMakeRoom"
msgid ""
"Oh, your BAG appears to be full.\p"
"Please make room in your BAG, then come\n"
"see me.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你的背包好像满了。\p"
"请在背包里腾出空间，\n"
"再来找我吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:537
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ThankYouForPlaying"
msgid "Thank you for playing!$"
msgstr "感谢你的参与！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:540
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_RecordWillBeSaved"
msgid ""
"Your record will be saved.\n"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"你的成绩将会被记录下来。\n"
"请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:544
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_WeveBeenWaitingForYou"
msgid "We've been waiting for you!$"
msgstr "我们一直在等你！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:547
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_OkayToSaveBeforeChallenge2"
msgid ""
"Before I show you to the BATTLE DOME,\n"
"I must save the data. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"带你去对战巨蛋之前，\n"
"我必须先记录数据。可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:551
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_WelcomeDoubleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the strategies of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE DOME!\p"
"I am your guide to the DOUBLE BATTLE\n"
"Tournament.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家战术的地方！\p"
"欢迎来到对战巨蛋！\p"
"我是双打锦标赛的向导。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:558
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_TakeDoublesChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to challenge\n"
"the DOUBLE BATTLE Tournament?$"
msgstr "你要挑战双打锦标赛吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:562
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ExplainDoublesChallenge"
msgid ""
"The DOUBLE BATTLE Tournament\n"
"is exactly as the name suggests--\l"
"a tournament of DOUBLE BATTLES.\p"
"All participating TRAINERS must\n"
"enter three POKéMON each.\p"
"In each battle, one of the three\n"
"POKéMON must be held in reserve.\p"
"The remaining two POKéMON must take\n"
"part in a DOUBLE BATTLE.\p"
"Choose the two battling POKéMON after\n"
"examining the opponent's trio.\p"
"You win the tournament by defeating\n"
"four TRAINERS.\p"
"Battle Points are awarded to\n"
"the tournament winner.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"tournament, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"双打锦标赛正如其名，\n"
"是双打对战的锦标赛。\p"
"所有参赛的训练家\n"
"都要各带3只宝可梦参加。\p"
"每场对战中，3只宝可梦里\n"
"必须有1只留作候补。\p"
"剩下的2只宝可梦\n"
"要进行双打对战。\p"
"请先观察对手的3只宝可梦，\n"
"再选择出战的2只宝可梦。\p"
"打败4位训练家，\n"
"就能赢得锦标赛冠军。\p"
"锦标赛的冠军\n"
"将获得对战点数。\p"
"如果想中断锦标赛，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:583
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_PrevTourneyResultsSinglesLv50"
msgid ""
"They're the results of the last\n"
"Level 50 SINGLE BATTLE Tournament.$"
msgstr ""
"这是上一届\n"
"Lv.50单打锦标赛的结果。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:587
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_PrevTourneyResultsDoublesLv50"
msgid ""
"They're the results of the last\n"
"Level 50 DOUBLE BATTLE Tournament.$"
msgstr ""
"这是上一届\n"
"Lv.50双打锦标赛的结果。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:591
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_PrevTourneyResultsSinglesLvOpen"
msgid ""
"They're the results of the last\n"
"Open Level SINGLE BATTLE Tournament.$"
msgstr ""
"这是上一届\n"
"自由等级单打锦标赛的结果。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:595
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_PrevTourneyResultsDoublesLvOpen"
msgid ""
"They're the results of the last\n"
"Open Level DOUBLE BATTLE Tournament.$"
msgstr ""
"这是上一届\n"
"自由等级双打锦标赛的结果。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:599
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_LastWinnerWasTough"
msgid ""
"Did you see it?\n"
"The last Battle Tournament?\p"
"The winner, {STR_VAR_1}, was seriously\n"
"tough.\p"
"You should check out the results\n"
"on the monitor beside the PC.$"
msgstr ""
"你看了吗？\n"
"上一届的对战锦标赛？\p"
"冠军{STR_VAR_1}真的强得不得了。\p"
"你应该去看看电脑旁边\n"
"显示屏上的结果。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:607
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_LongDreamedAboutBattleFrontier"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE FRONTIER…\n"
"I've long dreamed about a place like it.$"
msgstr ""
"对战开拓区……\n"
"我一直梦想着有这样一个地方。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:612
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_BattleDomeSign2"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE DOME\n"
"Become the Unbeatable Superstar!$"
msgstr ""
"对战巨蛋\n"
"成为无敌的巨星吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:617
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_QuestionMarkUnderConstruction"
msgid ""
"The ??????\n"
"Under Construction!$"
msgstr ""
"？？？？？？\n"
"施工中！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:621
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_WinnersGainReputation"
msgid ""
"When a TRAINER chains tournament\n"
"wins at the BATTLE DOME, he or she\l"
"gains a reputation as a star.\p"
"Tough TRAINERS are drawn by that\n"
"reputation to the BATTLE DOME.\p"
"A true superstar is a TRAINER who\n"
"can keep winning tournaments.$"
msgstr ""
"在对战巨蛋连续夺冠的训练家，\n"
"会获得巨星的名声。\p"
"强大的训练家们会被这名声\n"
"吸引到对战巨蛋来。\p"
"能够不断赢得锦标赛的训练家，\n"
"才是真正的巨星。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:630
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_TrashedInFirstRound"
msgid ""
"I ran into one of the tournament\n"
"favorites in the very first round.\p"
"Of course I got trashed…$"
msgstr ""
"我在第一轮就碰上了\n"
"锦标赛的夺冠热门。\p"
"当然被打得惨败……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:635
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_NeedToCheckOpponentCarefully"
msgid ""
"I would've won if I'd kept this POKéMON\n"
"held in reserve.\p"
"You need to check your opponent's\n"
"POKéMON carefully before choosing\l"
"your battling POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"要是我把这只宝可梦留作候补，\n"
"就能赢了。\p"
"在选择出战的宝可梦之前，\n"
"要仔细观察对手的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:642
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_CongratsDefeatedTucker"
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\p"
"You defeated the DOME ACE and won\n"
"the Battle Tournament!$"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你！\p"
"你打败了巨蛋王牌，\n"
"赢得了对战锦标赛的冠军！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:647
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_AwardTheseBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"In recognition of your strategy--\n"
"a thing of beauty it was, too--\l"
"we award you these Battle Point(s)!$"
msgstr ""
"为了表彰你的战术——\n"
"那真是太漂亮了——\l"
"我们将这些对战点数送给你！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:652
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_RecordLastMatch"
msgid ""
"Would you like to record your\n"
"last BATTLE DOME match on your\l"
"FRONTIER PASS?$"
msgstr ""
"要把你上一场对战巨蛋的对战\n"
"录到开拓通行证里吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:657
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid ""
"The Battle Tournament rules\n"
"are listed.$"
msgstr "上面列着对战锦标赛的规则。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:661
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr "你要阅读哪一项？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:664
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ExplainMatchupRules"
msgid ""
"The tournament matchups are drawn up\n"
"based on the toughness of POKéMON\l"
"held by TRAINERS.\p"
"The matchups avoid having tough\n"
"TRAINERS face each other right away.$"
msgstr ""
"锦标赛的对阵是根据\n"
"训练家所带宝可梦的强度\l"
"来安排的。\p"
"对阵会避免强大的训练家\n"
"一开始就互相碰面。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:671
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ExplainTourneyTree"
msgid ""
"The tournament chart, or as we call it,\n"
"the “Tree,” is available for viewing\l"
"in the Waiting Room from any guide.\p"
"The Tournament Tree will provide\n"
"several kinds of data.\p"
"The data on view includes the previous\n"
"tournament's results, the POKéMON held\l"
"by TRAINERS, and the battle styles of\l"
"TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""
"锦标赛的对阵表，\n"
"也就是我们所说的“树形图”，\l"
"在等候室里可以找任何一位\l"
"向导查看。\p"
"对阵树形图提供了\n"
"各种各样的数据。\p"
"可以看到的数据包括\n"
"上一届锦标赛的结果、\l"
"训练家所带的宝可梦，\l"
"以及训练家的对战风格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby/scripts.inc:682
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby_Text_ExplainDoubleKORules"
msgid ""
"If battling POKéMON faint at the same\n"
"time--a double KO--in a tournament\l"
"match, the REFEREES will review\l"
"the match and declare the winner.$"
msgstr ""
"如果在锦标赛的比赛中，\n"
"对战的宝可梦同时倒下——\l"
"也就是双方同时倒下，\l"
"裁判会审查比赛并判定胜者。$"
